# Blurred Scroll — vertical list of 10 Skia gradient cards; as a card scrolls
# past the centre it blurs (layer Blur sigma interpolated per frame), tilts and
# shrinks, so only the centred card is sharp.
# What this test covers: slow item-by-item drags (blur 0.1 -> 40 -> 0.1 per
# card), a held drag stopping half-way between two cards, flings to the end of
# the list and overscroll past it, slow drags back up through every card, and
# a fling interrupted by a touch. Upward travel stays short of the top: a
# pull-down at the top of the list is the app's close gesture.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/blurred-scroll"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait 1500
# One card at a time (~393pt each).
gesture pan 200 650 0 -390 900
wait 600
gesture pan 200 650 0 -390 900
wait 600
# Stop half-way: maximum blur on the outgoing card.
gesture pan 200 650 0 -200 1200
wait 1000
gesture pan 200 650 0 -190 900
wait 600
# Flings to the end, and overscroll past it.
swipe 200 780 200 150
wait 300
swipe 200 780 200 150
wait 300
swipe 200 780 200 150
wait 300
swipe 200 780 200 150
wait 1500
swipe 200 780 200 150
wait 1500
# Fling back up and stop it with a touch.
swipe 200 250 200 700
wait 150
press 200 437
wait 800
# Slow drags back up, card by card.
gesture pan 200 250 0 390 900
wait 600
gesture pan 200 250 0 390 900
wait 600
gesture pan 200 250 0 300 900
wait 800
# And down again quickly.
swipe 200 780 200 150
wait 1500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
